hi my name is Samuel Leeds and in this  video I want to talk to you about how to  get motivated sellers direct without  having to go through an agent whilst  estate agents do have their place and I  love estate agents and I'm actively  buying from estate agents and when they  know you now will bring you the best  kind of deals but sometimes it can be a  bit easier certainly to begin with to go  direct to a motivated seller and  sometimes you get the best deals that  way so here are the five top ways to buy  properties direct to vendor so number  one is Facebook I get a lot of people  messaging me on Facebook saying I'm  selling my house or my friend or my  brother is selling their house and I get  a lot of good deals that way then you  can advertise on Facebook but well I  think the best way is is to just join  facebook groups in your local area join  the Facebook groups let people know that  your property investor put yourself out  there get into conversations social  media is an absolute beast and you can  talk to people like you've never been  able to do in history so use it utilize  it and find motivated sellers online  number two is notice boards a lot of  shop sometimes they are like a  mainstream shop sometimes little off  licenses but they have little notice  boards where you can advertise things  and put things sometimes it's free since  I have to pay a pound or something but  in your local area or in your patch if  you just go into these shops and just  put little post-it notes on the notice  boards and just say something like I'm  looking to buy houses in this postcode  if you're looking to sell give me a call  on you'll be really surprised at the  response rate you can get and you'll get  motivated sellers phoning you instead of  you having to chase estate agents number  three is leaflet drops now if you've got  a particular area or a patch where  you're looking to buy properties maybe  there's certain streets and houses even  particularly then you can pay people  around about thirty pounds to deliver  1,000 leaflets so you can literally just  bombard all the houses in your area with  leaflets which again will say something  similar like I'm looking to buy houses  in this area  please give me a call if you're  interested in selling and again you're  gonna get people phoning you who want to  sell their house motivated sellers  direct with no agent this is something  that I've done a lot in the past and  typically if you do this right you can  get some really really good deals you  can also with leaflets instead of  handing them out on mass or paying  someone to send out thousands keep them  in your car and every time you see a  house that looks like it needs a little  bit of work or it's a bit derelict or if  you see a property that's got to as  state agency boards and you've noticed  it's been on a little while just walk up  and pop it through the letterbox but the  leaflets are a really really good way to  get motivated sellers coming direct to  you number four networking  now when I say networking I have been  talking about in just everyday life  networking but also there are formal  specific networking events that go on  all over the UK every single day  there are breakfasts there are dinners  where business people meet and say how  can we help you in your business now  when I started out at 17 years old I  joined all these networking events not  just property networking events just  business events turned up and would say  I'm looking to buy properties that are  bargain prices and discounted if you  know you want this motivated that's  selling their property I'd love you to  let me know what happen is all of these  business people will then actively be  looking for deals for you and you'll be  looking for deals for them and you just  helped one know that way getting into a  good networking group for me was  absolutely transformational with my  business it's also good because you'll  learn a lot about business as well so I  know it's a bit daunting for some people  like oh my gosh just walking up to a  networking event but just do it get  yourself uncomfortable because if you're  not being uncomfortable and you're not  stretching then you're not growing and  you're dying so get down to a networking  event my challenge is to book on today  to a networking event for next week  number five lastly and this is to be  honest my favorite and probably the  easiest is there are online sites where  you can literally find motivated sellers  direct with their telephone number on  their sites like Gumtree calm open rent  Cote UK it's like right move and  you see a lists of all these houses but  instead of the agents number  there's the vendors number the motivated  sellers number direct where you can  phone them up no agent and get a deal  direct so I hope that video has been  helpful whenever we publish these videos  mentoring Monday videos at 7 p.m. for  the first hour I am on they're  responding to everyone's comments and  questions so please do put your  questions in your comments below I've  read every single one of them and I'll  do my best to comment back as well  thanks so much I'll see you next time  [Music]  [Music]
 

